Package: digitalvalue
Title: Digital Initiatives Value Assessment
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Frenk", "Giorgetti", email = "frenk.giorgetti@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Shiny application, structured as an R package, to record digital
    initiatives and assess their value through a staged process: Phase I
    qualitative prioritisation (RICE), Phase II monetary valuation (PRMT:
    production, reserves, monetary, time), Phase III planning review, and a
    post-closure audit of materialised value. User activity is logged and
    grouped into process phases to support process mining.
